// ek3562 board device tree (FIT conf / board_id = ek3562).
// Git source of truth: overlay/kernel/rockchip/ek3562.dts — synced by make apply-overlay.
// Hardware baseline: Rockchip RK3562 EVB2 DDR4 V10 Board (live FDT model /
// compatible matched 2026-08-15). Same include set as
// rk3562-evb2-ddr4-v10-linux.dts, plus ek3562-io for PCA9535 / silk I/O.
// SoC skeletons (rk3562.dtsi, rk3562-pinctrl.dtsi, rockchip-pinconf.dtsi) stay
// in the owned linux-sdk kernel tree — do not fork them here until we must.
// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
